00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:39.900
all right, if I have COVID,

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:42.864
I got to tell like, Joey,
and got to tell Garnt,

00:07:42.864 --> 00:07:43.950
got to tell everyone I've
been in contact with,

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:46.140
I've got to tell them
everywhere I've been,

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:47.850
I've got to stay at home for two weeks,

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:49.500
I'm like, fuck, fuck,

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.203
like everything.
- Yeah.

00:07:51.203 --> 00:07:52.902
- And then when she said that to me,

00:07:52.902 --> 00:07:54.363
I'm like fuck, oh no!

00:07:54.363 --> 00:07:55.486
- It's bad.

00:07:55.486 --> 00:07:56.325
(laughing)

00:07:56.325 --> 00:07:57.963
