I need another one mom.

00:14:39.004 --> 00:14:40.028
(laughing)

00:14:40.028 --> 00:14:42.930
'Cause that shit tastes
too good to be a medicine.

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:44.140
- We had something like that in Australia,

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:45.743
but it was cough syrup.

00:14:45.743 --> 00:14:46.911
- Yeah.
- Right.

00:14:46.911 --> 00:14:47.744
- And normally,

00:14:47.744 --> 00:14:49.010
it's like strawberry
flavored cough syrup right?

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:50.216
- Yeah.

00:14:50.216 --> 00:14:51.049
